# Controller QA harness reports (generated per run, not source)
tests/controller-qa/reports/

# ── PUBLIC / PRIVATE BOUNDARY (read docs/PUBLIC_PRIVATE_BOUNDARY.md) ──────────
# infrastructure/ is PRIVATE — it is NEVER committed to this public repo.
# It holds business/site infra (auth+payments backend, CloudFront/S3, analytics,
# pack gating) and marketing strategy (Postiz, posting playbooks, reddit ladders,
# trailer treatments). None of it is reusable Godot tooling; all of it is either
# sensitive attack surface or private strategy. The REUSABLE, public deploy
# templates were moved OUT to deploy/ precisely so this blanket ignore is safe.
infrastructure/

# Cross-browser QA harness reports (generated per run, not source)
tests/cross-browser-qa/reports/

